    src: https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Battle_of_Chaeronea%2C_338_BC.png/250px-Battle_of_Chaeronea%2C_338_BC.png
    width: 752
    height: 531
    caption: Battle plan from the Battle of Chaeronea
  - file: Pausanius_assassinates_Philip_during_the_procession_into_the_theatre_by_Andre_Castaigne_(1898-1899).jpg
