    height: 961
    caption: "Kingdoms of the Diadochi in 301 BC: the Ptolemaic Kingdom (dark
      blue), the Seleucid Empire (yellow), Kingdom of Lysimachus (orange), and
      Kingdom of Macedon (green). Also shown are the Roman Republic (light
      blue), the Carthaginian Republic (purple), and the Kingdom of Epirus
      (red)."
  - file: Lion_hunt_mosaic_from_Pella.jpg
